Recommends: qtwayland5, qt5-image-formats-plugins
Homepage: https://github.com/marlo4220mc/nevertube_qt2
Description: Lightweight YouTube client (Qt5 + libmpv)
 A lightweight YouTube client built with Qt5 and the mpv playback core.
 The menu entry and the icons are installed in the hicolor theme, so GNOME,
 KDE, XFCE, Cinnamon and MATE pick them up without per-DE files; the binary
 goes to /usr/bin.
